            "border_radius": 4,
            "border_color": "#cccccc",
            "border_style": "full",
            "question_color": "#1d1d1d",
            "question_bg_color": "#ffffff",
            "answer_color": "#2e2e2e",
            "answer_bg_color": "#fafafa",
            "accordion_mode": true,
            "question_1": "Description",
            "use_product_description_for_question_1": false,
            "answer_1": "<p>Elevate your everyday wellness with our premium Daily Greens Powder — a nutrient-dense blend of organic greens, fruits, and adaptogens designed to fuel your body from the inside out. Whether you're chasing energy, gut health, or immune support, this all-in-one daily ritual simplifies your nutrition and fits into any routine.</p><p>✓ Organic & plant-based<br/>✓ No added sugar or artificial ingredients<br/>✓ Vegan, gluten-free, and non-GMO</p>",
            "question_2": "How to Use",
            "answer_2": "<p>Enjoy once daily.</p><ul><li>Add <strong>1 scoop</strong> to <strong>250–350ml of cold water</strong>, juice, or your favorite smoothie.</li><li>Sprinkle over yogurt, oats, or mix into snacks for an extra nutrient boost.</li><li>Stir or shake well. Best taken in the morning or with your first meal.</li></ul><p>Mix with chilled coconut water for a nutrient-dense, hydrating beverage.</p>",
            "question_3": "Health Benefits",
            "answer_3": "<p>🌿 Supports Gut Health – With prebiotics, probiotics & digestive enzymes</p><p>⚡ Boosts Natural Energy – Green tea extract & adaptogenic herbs</p><p>🛡️ Strengthens Immunity – Loaded with vitamin C, zinc & antioxidants</p><p>💪 Reduces Bloat & Inflammation – Thanks to alkalizing greens like spirulina & chlorella</p><p>🧠 Enhances Focus & Mood – Includes nootropics like ashwagandha and lion’s mane</p>",
            "question_4": "Shipping & Returns",
            "answer_4": "<p>We ship worldwide from our fulfillment centers within 1–2 business days.</p><p><strong>Standard shipping times:</strong><br/><br/>🇺🇸 US: 3–5 business days<br/><br/>🇦🇺 AU/NZ: 4–8 business days<br/><br/>🇬🇧 UK/EU: 5–9 business days<br/><br/>🌍 International: 7–14 business days</p><p>All orders come with a <strong>30-day return guarantee.</strong> If you’re not completely satisfied with your order, you may return it for a full refund, provided the products are in the original packaging and are unused.</p>",
